WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.970
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.240 --> 01:43.910
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.320 --> 01:46.880
[Episode 14]

4
01:52.229 --> 01:53.039
Excuse me.

5
01:53.039 --> 01:53.840
May I ask how much

6
01:53.840 --> 01:55.500
longer till we reach Nanjing?

7
01:55.640 --> 01:56.430
Let me check.

8
01:57.120 --> 01:58.479
We'll reach Bengbu in a bit more than 3 hours.

9
01:58.479 --> 01:59.920
The stop following it is Nanjing.

10
01:59.920 --> 02:00.280
Thank you.

11
02:00.280 --> 02:01.740
Alright. Just be patient.

12
02:04.150 --> 02:05.840
Keep your voice down.

13
02:07.310 --> 02:08.030
First, throw a two.

14
02:08.030 --> 02:09.240
T-Then eight, nine, ten, jack, queen.

15
02:09.240 --> 02:10.570
It'll be a win, won't it?

16
02:11.120 --> 02:12.840
Isn't it a sure win when these cards are out?

17
02:12.840 --> 02:14.240
Do you even know how to play?

18
02:14.240 --> 02:15.640
What the heck is all this?

19
02:16.230 --> 02:17.240
Look at these cards.

20
02:17.240 --> 02:19.040
Winning cards they are, I'd say.

21
02:19.430 --> 02:20.690
Do you know how to play?

22
02:21.310 --> 02:21.910
With a joker

23
02:21.910 --> 02:22.960
and a straight, I'll win.

24
02:22.960 --> 02:23.680
You know?

25
02:23.680 --> 02:25.940
Go away if you don't know how poker works.

26
02:37.400 --> 02:38.470
Emergency notice!

27
02:39.079 --> 02:41.120
If there are any medical workers on board,

28
02:41.120 --> 02:42.720
please hurry to carriage 14.

29
02:43.280 --> 02:45.400
If there are any medical workers on board,

30
02:45.400 --> 02:47.000
please hurry to carriage 14.

31
02:49.310 --> 02:49.910
No one's coming to help.

32
02:49.910 --> 02:50.680
Repeat the announcement.

33
02:50.680 --> 02:51.810
Quick, say it again!

34
02:51.840 --> 02:52.560
Is there a doctor?

35
02:52.560 --> 02:53.710
We're trying to get one.

36
02:53.710 --> 02:54.310
-We're trying. -Let me through.

37
02:54.310 --> 02:54.800
There will be a doctor soon.

38
02:54.800 --> 02:56.060
Please let me through.

39
02:57.470 --> 02:58.520
W-Who are you?

40
02:58.520 --> 02:59.630
He's a doctor!

41
02:59.710 --> 03:00.430
You're a doctor, huh?

42
03:00.430 --> 03:01.150
Doctor!

43
03:01.150 --> 03:01.750
Check on her.

44
03:01.750 --> 03:02.520
What doesn't feel right?

45
03:02.520 --> 03:04.680
My stomach hurts, and I'm dizzy.

46
03:05.150 --> 03:05.630
Dizzy.

47
03:05.630 --> 03:07.400
Any history of high blood pressure?

48
03:07.400 --> 03:08.190
No.

49
03:08.560 --> 03:09.310
How far along are you?

50
03:09.310 --> 03:10.370
Over eight months.

51
03:10.590 --> 03:11.750
Thirty-two weeks and five days!

52
03:11.750 --> 03:12.280
That's right.

53
03:12.280 --> 03:13.120
Now let her lie flat.

54
03:13.120 --> 03:14.080
Nice and slow.

55
03:14.080 --> 03:16.280
-Slowly. Watch your head. -Here you go.

56
03:16.360 --> 03:17.470
When the pain first kicked in,

57
03:17.470 --> 03:18.750
I thought I could bear it for a while.

58
03:18.750 --> 03:19.610
Bend your legs.

59
03:19.630 --> 03:20.590
-Get a curtain here. Quick! -But it got worse and worse.

60
03:20.590 --> 03:21.840
Hurry, get a curtain here!

61
03:21.840 --> 03:22.240
Make it quick!

62
03:22.240 --> 03:23.100
You'll be fine.

63
03:26.000 --> 03:26.960
How long is the interval

64
03:26.960 --> 03:27.870
between pain attacks?

65
03:27.870 --> 03:29.360
The pain comes about

66
03:29.360 --> 03:30.590
every five minutes.

67
03:30.800 --> 03:32.110
What's there to do, doctor?

68
03:32.110 --> 03:33.310
Will my baby be okay?

69
03:33.310 --> 03:34.280
It'll be okay.

70
03:34.430 --> 03:35.190
Train attendant,

71
03:35.190 --> 03:36.240
notify the next station

72
03:36.240 --> 03:37.840
to arrange for an ambulance.

73
03:37.870 --> 03:39.079
I've notified them.

74
03:39.310 --> 03:40.430
Ask the receiving hospital

75
03:40.430 --> 03:41.079
to get prepared

76
03:41.079 --> 03:42.190
to rescue a newborn.

77
03:42.190 --> 03:43.310
Breech presentation.

78
03:43.310 --> 03:44.440
What does that mean?

79
03:44.560 --> 03:45.870
Never mind. Just say it to them!

80
03:45.870 --> 03:46.630
Okay, got it.

81
03:46.870 --> 03:47.910
Quickly notify the doctors

82
03:47.910 --> 03:48.840
in the hospital.

83
03:49.310 --> 03:50.079
Lie on your side.

84
03:50.079 --> 03:51.210
Here, nice and slow.

85
03:51.310 --> 03:51.840
Make it quick!

86
03:51.840 --> 03:52.630
Doctor,

87
03:52.840 --> 03:54.310
am I going to die?

88
03:54.310 --> 03:55.030
No.

89
03:55.710 --> 03:58.240
Will my baby be okay?

90
03:58.280 --> 03:59.470
Now, look in my eyes.

91
03:59.710 --> 04:00.680
Stay composed.

92
04:01.190 --> 04:02.030
I promise that both

93
04:02.030 --> 04:03.590
you and your baby will be fine,

94
04:03.590 --> 04:04.400
alright?

95
04:04.590 --> 04:06.430
Next, just do as I say.

96
04:06.840 --> 04:08.590
Breathe in through your nose and out through your mouth.

97
04:08.590 --> 04:09.360
Can you do that?

98
04:09.360 --> 04:10.680
Come on, breathe in.

99
04:14.240 --> 04:15.080
Breathe out.

100
04:16.920 --> 04:17.600
Right.

101
04:17.600 --> 04:18.190
Again.

102
04:18.560 --> 04:19.360
Breathe in.

103
04:21.720 --> 04:22.560
Breathe out.

104
04:24.800 --> 04:26.600
That's right. You're doing great.

105
04:26.600 --> 04:28.430
Adjust your breathing. Repeat what you just did.

106
04:28.430 --> 04:29.240
Breathe in.

107
04:47.159 --> 04:48.090
I won't drink it.

108
04:57.190 --> 04:58.520
I heard from Zhengguang

109
04:59.240 --> 05:00.700
that Liu Zhengliang left.

110
05:02.750 --> 05:03.600
Are you upset?

111
05:04.310 --> 05:05.240
Not really.

112
05:06.390 --> 05:07.990
There's nothing between us.

113
05:09.270 --> 05:11.200
Then what was on your mind just now?

114
05:12.480 --> 05:13.560
N-Nothing.

115
05:13.560 --> 05:14.690
I simply spaced out.

116
05:17.190 --> 05:18.650
The principle I stick to is

117
05:20.070 --> 05:22.830
that you should fight for what you like

118
05:22.950 --> 05:24.750
and spare no effort while you're at it.

119
05:24.750 --> 05:25.560
Try your best

120
05:26.430 --> 05:27.750
and leave no regrets.

121
05:29.480 --> 05:31.340
If you can't stand him being away,

122
05:31.750 --> 05:33.360
I'll go to the South with you

123
05:33.680 --> 05:35.040
to bring him back.

124
05:35.270 --> 05:36.120
Forget it.

125
05:37.070 --> 05:38.680
He's in a special situation.

126
05:38.680 --> 05:40.310
Why do we have to force him?

127
05:45.040 --> 05:46.600
Then haven't you thought about

128
05:46.600 --> 05:48.330
building a career in the South?

129
05:50.870 --> 05:52.390
What can I do there?

130
05:52.630 --> 05:53.870
The funeral business

131
05:53.870 --> 05:55.159
varies with regions.

132
05:55.430 --> 05:56.870
There's a fixed group of practitioners

133
05:56.870 --> 05:58.159
in every area.

134
05:58.390 --> 05:59.750
How do I even get started?

135
05:59.750 --> 06:01.480
If I leave this line of business

136
06:01.750 --> 06:02.870
and lose my job,

137
06:02.950 --> 06:04.000
how do I live on?

138
06:05.120 --> 06:06.430
How do I support myself?

139
06:06.430 --> 06:07.560
By relying on Liu Zhengliang?

140
06:07.560 --> 06:08.430
No way.

141
06:10.040 --> 06:11.190
Let me be clear with you.

142
06:11.190 --> 06:12.000
Ai Chen

143
06:12.600 --> 06:14.240
can be someone's wife,

144
06:14.240 --> 06:15.510
but she can't just be

145
06:15.510 --> 06:16.750
someone's wife.

146
06:16.950 --> 06:17.750
You get it?

147
06:18.160 --> 06:19.360
Hearing you say that,

148
06:20.390 --> 06:21.630
I feel so relieved.

149
06:28.360 --> 06:29.360
So that was a test?

150
06:29.510 --> 06:31.240
I was afraid you'd act foolish.

151
06:35.000 --> 06:36.800
Give me some credit, will you?

152
06:40.560 --> 06:43.240
Liu Zhengliang doesn't have a great personality.

153
06:43.240 --> 06:44.560
What do you see in him?

154
06:45.430 --> 06:46.830
Is it that he's scholarly

155
06:47.270 --> 06:47.870
and smart?

156
06:53.560 --> 06:54.600
At first,

157
06:55.120 --> 06:57.120
I did like him for being a doctor.

158
06:57.510 --> 06:58.800
But later,

159
07:00.240 --> 07:02.240
I realized that I also liked

160
07:03.740 --> 07:05.470
the vulnerability he carries.

161
07:06.630 --> 07:07.430
What?

162
07:08.750 --> 07:10.310
I mean it's like he'd break

163
07:10.310 --> 07:11.800
at the slightest touch.

164
07:14.510 --> 07:15.440
Anything wrong?

165
07:16.160 --> 07:17.920
Girls usually like tough men.

166
07:18.160 --> 07:20.160
Who would fall for a vulnerable guy?

167
07:21.390 --> 07:22.190
Sweetie,

168
07:22.630 --> 07:24.760
you think you're picking crisps here?

169
07:53.870 --> 07:54.800
Liu Zhengliang,

170
07:54.870 --> 07:56.830
you really left at the right time.

171
08:04.080 --> 08:06.980
[Bengbu Station]

172
08:17.070 --> 08:18.310
Here comes the doctor.

173
08:18.310 --> 08:19.310
Hurry.

174
08:19.310 --> 08:20.070
Thank you.

175
08:20.070 --> 08:20.390
No problem.

176
08:20.390 --> 08:21.920
Put her on nasal oxygen now.

177
08:23.040 --> 08:24.160
What's the situation?

178
08:24.160 --> 08:25.000
Aged 31.

179
08:25.000 --> 08:26.000
At 32 weeks and 5 days of gestation.

180
08:26.000 --> 08:27.240
Contractions every three minutes,

181
08:27.240 --> 08:27.950
lasting 60 seconds

182
08:27.950 --> 08:29.360
at high intensity levels.

183
08:29.360 --> 08:30.430
Any pelvic exam done yet?

184
08:30.430 --> 08:31.190
No, for conditions

185
08:31.190 --> 08:32.120
didn't allow it.

186
08:32.600 --> 08:33.659
Does it still hurt?

187
08:33.720 --> 08:34.360
I'm much better now.

188
08:34.360 --> 08:35.559
The pain has eased up.

189
08:36.440 --> 08:37.510
If it doesn't hurt much,

190
08:37.510 --> 08:38.270
just hold on a bit

191
08:38.270 --> 08:39.000
and get off the train now.

192
08:39.000 --> 08:40.120
The ambulance is right outside.

193
08:40.120 --> 08:41.390
Alright. You're perfectly fine.

194
08:41.390 --> 08:41.720
This way.

195
08:41.720 --> 08:42.360
Careful.

196
08:42.360 --> 08:42.840
Slowly.

197
08:42.840 --> 08:44.300
Don't forget the clothes.

198
08:44.510 --> 08:45.120
Nice and slow.

199
08:45.120 --> 08:46.150
Passengers nearby, please make way.

200
08:46.150 --> 08:46.880
Hold on to me.

201
08:47.390 --> 08:49.390
Passengers ahead, please make way.

202
08:49.390 --> 08:50.440
Boarding passengers,

203
08:50.440 --> 08:51.440
please step back.

204
08:52.510 --> 08:52.790
Careful.

205
08:52.790 --> 08:54.360
There's a pregnant woman here.

206
08:54.360 --> 08:55.320
Watch your step.

207
08:55.320 --> 08:56.480
Watch your step.

208
08:57.320 --> 08:58.120
Nice and slow.

209
09:01.480 --> 09:03.080
One, two, three!

210
09:04.240 --> 09:05.170
Slowly lie down.

211
09:05.440 --> 09:06.120
Slowly.

212
09:08.360 --> 09:09.150
Careful.

213
09:09.240 --> 09:10.840
I think my water just broke.

214
09:12.790 --> 09:13.510
Doctor!

215
09:13.510 --> 09:14.440
Cover her with clothes.

216
09:14.440 --> 09:15.120
Doctor!

217
09:15.120 --> 09:15.550
It's okay.

218
09:15.550 --> 09:16.550
Just lie down.

219
09:16.550 --> 09:17.680
-Careful. -Doctor!

220
09:18.480 --> 09:19.810
Give me sterile gloves.

221
09:19.870 --> 09:21.670
It's okay, honey. Hang in there!

222
09:22.080 --> 09:23.280
It's going to be fine.

223
09:23.960 --> 09:24.820
It hurts so bad.

224
09:25.360 --> 09:26.240
I can't take it anymore.

225
09:26.240 --> 09:26.960
This is bad.

226
09:27.150 --> 09:27.960
The umbilical cord prolapsed.

227
09:27.960 --> 09:29.360
The baby is still inside.

228
09:29.840 --> 09:30.600
We have 5 minutes at most.

229
09:30.600 --> 09:31.440
The baby's in danger.

230
09:31.440 --> 09:32.510
The cord has to be pushed back in.

231
09:32.510 --> 09:33.670
Go! Get her into the ambulance now!

232
09:33.670 --> 09:34.360
Move!

233
09:34.870 --> 09:35.630
Doctor!

234
09:36.000 --> 09:37.480
What about your luggage?

235
09:44.070 --> 09:46.370
[Bengbu City Emergency Rescue Center]

236
09:46.420 --> 09:48.150
[120]

237
09:48.790 --> 09:50.320
Blood pressure 140 over 95.

238
09:50.320 --> 09:51.840
Blood oxygen 95%.

239
09:54.120 --> 09:55.960
Any delivery kit or episiotomy kit?

240
09:55.960 --> 09:56.600
Yes.

241
09:56.670 --> 09:57.530
Pass them to me.

242
09:58.960 --> 10:00.160
You have to push hard.

243
10:01.600 --> 10:02.600
Come on. Push.

244
10:02.600 --> 10:03.510
Adjust your breathing.

245
10:03.510 --> 10:04.390
Breathe, honey.

246
10:04.390 --> 10:05.000
Breathe.

247
10:05.030 --> 10:05.670
Push!

248
10:05.670 --> 10:07.000
Yes. Bite me if you have to, honey.

249
10:07.000 --> 10:07.840
Bite me hard.

250
10:07.840 --> 10:08.550
Come on.

251
10:08.750 --> 10:09.910
Push hard!

252
10:11.950 --> 10:13.550
[Bengbu City Emergency Rescue Center]

253
10:12.360 --> 10:13.200
Honey, hang in there.

254
10:13.200 --> 10:13.630
Honey.

255
10:13.630 --> 10:14.670
Push harder. Push!

256
10:14.670 --> 10:15.550
Come on, push!

257
10:16.870 --> 10:17.930
It'll be over soon.

258
10:19.910 --> 10:20.720
Push!

259
10:20.750 --> 10:21.550
Harder!

260
10:21.600 --> 10:22.360
The baby's born.

261
10:22.360 --> 10:23.320
The baby's born.

262
10:23.320 --> 10:24.650
Honey, the baby's born!

263
10:25.510 --> 10:27.170
Curved forceps and scissors.

264
10:32.240 --> 10:36.150
[Bengbu City Emergency Rescue Center]

265
10:55.390 --> 10:56.590
Come on, sweetheart.

266
10:56.960 --> 10:57.960
Let me carry you.

267
10:58.150 --> 10:59.910
My precious little girl.

268
11:01.390 --> 11:02.590
It's okay. It's okay.

269
11:03.200 --> 11:04.080
Alright.

270
11:04.320 --> 11:04.960
Your feet.

271
11:05.080 --> 11:07.210
We're finally getting home after such

272
11:07.320 --> 11:08.550
a long stay in the hospital.

273
11:08.550 --> 11:09.150
How am I

274
11:09.150 --> 11:10.360
feeling a bit uneasy?

275
11:10.360 --> 11:12.030
It's great news that our daughter's being discharged.

276
11:12.030 --> 11:12.790
Don't overthink it.

277
11:12.790 --> 11:13.870
Come on, let's go.

278
11:14.000 --> 11:15.120
Y-You push the wheelchair.

279
11:15.120 --> 11:15.510
I'll take this.

280
11:15.510 --> 11:17.270
Sweetheart, we're going home!

281
11:15.970 --> 11:19.500
[Yellow Zone]

282
11:17.480 --> 11:18.000
Let's go.

283
11:18.000 --> 11:18.630
There we go.

284
11:18.630 --> 11:19.440
I can manage.

285
11:19.500 --> 11:22.110
[Keep the ward clean and tidy]

286
11:40.290 --> 11:43.660
♪ The melting snow and the warm wind ♪

287
11:43.850 --> 11:46.150
♪ The flowers bloom again ♪

288
11:47.270 --> 11:49.000
Today is such a wonderful day.

289
11:47.460 --> 11:53.160
♪ It's spring; it's a remedy ♪

290
11:50.240 --> 11:51.630
Everyone in our hospital

291
11:51.630 --> 11:52.720
is happy for you.

292
11:54.440 --> 11:55.480
Inside these two big bags

293
11:55.070 --> 11:58.680
♪ Stop and go, travelling separately ♪

294
11:55.480 --> 11:57.550
is the medication Zhang Jiao needs to take routinely

295
11:57.550 --> 11:58.550
for her recovery.

296
11:58.720 --> 12:01.200
It's also a token of goodwill

297
11:58.940 --> 12:01.020
♪ At the next intersection ♪

298
12:01.440 --> 12:02.550
from all the hospital staff.

299
12:02.550 --> 12:04.300
♪ You and I ♪

300
12:02.910 --> 12:04.670
We wish the child all the best,

301
12:04.960 --> 12:06.100
and may all things go well.

302
12:06.100 --> 12:08.780
♪ Travel light ♪

303
12:06.600 --> 12:08.390
Thanks. Thank you, President.

304
12:08.390 --> 12:09.030
Thank you.

305
12:09.030 --> 12:09.750
Thank you.

306
12:10.060 --> 12:16.190
♪ Put the past weighing on my back into the moon ♪

307
12:11.000 --> 12:11.790
Jiao,

308
12:12.240 --> 12:14.840
we hope you grow up healthy and happy.

309
12:17.530 --> 12:22.690
♪ Longing makes me wake up ♪

310
12:19.720 --> 12:21.200
T-Thank you.

311
12:23.600 --> 12:27.290
♪ To the open window♪

312
12:28.170 --> 12:34.880
♪ Softly, the person in my dream is like the moonlight ♪

313
12:35.400 --> 12:39.570
♪ Falling on my heart softly and taking me ♪

314
12:38.430 --> 12:43.040
[Emergency]

315
12:39.780 --> 12:42.400
♪ To our old familiar place ♪

316
12:41.000 --> 12:41.790
Thank you.

317
12:43.040 --> 12:49.450
♪ Slowly, the petals falls to the center of the lake when I miss you ♪

318
12:43.440 --> 12:45.300
Jiao, you're finally going home.

319
12:45.600 --> 12:46.460
Time to go home.

320
12:46.840 --> 12:47.900
Thank you, Dr. Che.

321
12:49.720 --> 12:50.910
Many thanks to Xiaoximen Hospital!

322
12:50.310 --> 12:54.380
♪ Ripples echo through the years, with our shadows faced each other ♪

323
12:53.000 --> 12:53.870
Let's go home!

324
12:54.760 --> 13:00.230
♪ We were together on the way we came ♪

325
12:55.600 --> 12:56.730
Have a safe journey.

326
12:58.720 --> 13:02.510
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

327
13:02.630 --> 13:09.120
[Emergency Access Route; No Parking]

328
13:13.910 --> 13:15.240
Mingming!

329
13:16.360 --> 13:17.120
Who are you?

330
13:20.270 --> 13:21.390
Put me down!

331
13:21.600 --> 13:22.360
Down!

332
13:24.870 --> 13:25.670
Huang.

333
13:26.630 --> 13:27.760
You're back, buddy.

334
13:27.790 --> 13:28.670
Yes, I'm back.

335
13:31.000 --> 13:32.130
T-This is Zhang Hao.

336
13:32.430 --> 13:33.390
Nice to meet you.

337
13:33.790 --> 13:34.920
Nice to meet you too.

338
14:11.390 --> 14:12.720
Fortunately, it was handled in time.

339
14:11.610 --> 14:13.470
[Welcome baby]

340
14:12.720 --> 14:13.790
So your wife is fine.

341
14:13.790 --> 14:15.240
Let her stay a while in hospital for observation.

342
14:14.310 --> 14:15.900
[How to welcome a newborn]

343
14:15.720 --> 14:16.750
Thank you for your help, doctor.

344
14:16.750 --> 14:17.750
Thank you so much.

345
14:22.860 --> 14:26.510
[Fetal sex identification for non-medical reasons is prohibited]

346
14:25.910 --> 14:26.720
Excuse me.

347
14:26.530 --> 14:29.700
[Fetal sex identification for non-medical reasons is prohibited]

348
14:27.840 --> 14:28.630
Hello.

349
14:29.360 --> 14:30.000
I...

350
14:30.000 --> 14:31.460
Thank you so much, doctor.

351
14:31.870 --> 14:32.510
My wife and child

352
14:32.510 --> 14:33.480
wouldn't have made it without you.

353
14:33.480 --> 14:34.080
Thank you, doctor.

354
14:34.080 --> 14:34.550
Thank you so much.

355
14:34.550 --> 14:35.270
You're welcome.

356
14:35.270 --> 14:36.000
Well,

357
14:36.030 --> 14:37.360
no more thanks for now.

358
14:37.480 --> 14:38.240
There's a more

359
14:38.240 --> 14:40.150
prominent problem to solve at the moment.

360
14:40.150 --> 14:40.960
Well,

361
14:40.960 --> 14:42.750
I should have arrived

362
14:42.750 --> 14:44.000
in Nanjing by now.

363
14:44.030 --> 14:44.790
But we had to get off

364
14:44.790 --> 14:45.990
in Bengbu, didn't we?

365
14:46.360 --> 14:47.240
So... about

366
14:48.080 --> 14:49.080
the train ticket,

367
14:49.080 --> 14:50.390
do you think you can...

368
14:50.960 --> 14:51.630
No problem.

369
14:51.630 --> 14:52.030
I'll buy you

370
14:52.030 --> 14:54.160
the best seat on the high-speed train.

371
14:55.120 --> 14:56.120
Here's the thing.

372
14:56.630 --> 14:57.840
Actually, I was heading

373
14:57.840 --> 14:58.840
for Nanjing just to transfer

374
14:58.840 --> 14:59.720
to Fuzhou.

375
15:00.440 --> 15:01.150
But now it seems

376
15:01.150 --> 15:02.840
I'll miss that train too.

377
15:08.670 --> 15:09.840
Here's all the cash I have on me.

378
15:09.840 --> 15:10.840
Look. Take it all.

379
15:10.840 --> 15:11.630
See if it's enough.

380
15:11.630 --> 15:11.960
If not,

381
15:11.960 --> 15:12.720
I'll go get some more

382
15:12.720 --> 15:13.200
from the ATM now.

383
15:13.200 --> 15:14.030
Just give me a sec, doctor.

384
15:14.030 --> 15:14.870
No, don't.

385
15:15.320 --> 15:16.600
It's more than enough.

386
15:17.480 --> 15:18.240
How about this?

387
15:18.240 --> 15:19.080
Leave me

388
15:19.080 --> 15:20.120
your contact info.

389
15:20.120 --> 15:20.840
So I can return the extra

390
15:20.840 --> 15:22.440
to you after I refund or change

391
15:22.440 --> 15:23.750
the ticket at the train station.

392
15:23.750 --> 15:24.440
No need, doctor.

393
15:24.440 --> 15:25.030
Consider

394
15:25.030 --> 15:26.910
the extra as a token of my appreciation.

395
15:26.910 --> 15:28.120
Just take all the money.

396
15:28.120 --> 15:30.380
Buy yourself clothes or something else.

397
15:33.870 --> 15:34.550
Fine then.

398
15:35.030 --> 15:35.840
Well,

399
15:36.550 --> 15:37.610
congratulations.

400
15:38.000 --> 15:38.790
Goodbye.

401
15:39.000 --> 15:39.630
Thank you.

402
15:40.440 --> 15:41.500
Take care, doctor.

403
15:42.240 --> 15:44.540
[Bengbu Chaokang Hospital]

404
15:49.150 --> 15:52.940
[Bengbu Chaokang Hospital]

405
15:55.790 --> 15:57.200
Sir, to the train station.

406
15:57.200 --> 15:58.670
I'm in a rush. Thanks.

407
16:05.480 --> 16:06.200
Bro,

408
16:06.510 --> 16:07.710
what happened to you?

409
16:09.080 --> 16:10.010
What do you mean?

410
16:10.320 --> 16:11.840
There's so much blood on you.

411
16:11.840 --> 16:14.240
How am I supposed to take other passengers?

412
16:14.670 --> 16:16.470
None of it has gotten on your car.

413
16:17.630 --> 16:19.120
But it smells.

414
16:19.200 --> 16:20.320
What smell?

415
16:20.320 --> 16:21.200
I've been in here for so long.

416
16:21.200 --> 16:21.840
Just drive.

417
16:21.840 --> 16:22.840
Time is pressing.

418
16:25.240 --> 16:26.720
Are you from the Northeast, given that accent?

419
16:26.720 --> 16:27.720
No, maybe you are.

420
16:27.790 --> 16:29.520
Yes, I am, through and through.

421
16:30.750 --> 16:32.470
How come there are Northeasterners everywhere?

422
16:32.470 --> 16:33.070
Excuse me?

423
16:33.270 --> 16:34.600
What's wrong with the Northeasterners?

424
16:34.600 --> 16:35.460
Nothing wrong.

425
16:40.390 --> 16:42.080
Listen, get out of my car.

426
16:42.080 --> 16:42.790
I'm not doing

427
16:42.790 --> 16:43.850
business with you.

428
16:44.870 --> 16:46.080
What do you mean, sir?

429
16:46.150 --> 16:46.870
Why can't you finish the ride?

430
16:46.870 --> 16:47.840
I'm in a hurry.

431
16:48.000 --> 16:48.910
I'm telling you,

432
16:48.910 --> 16:50.080
I hate you regional bigots

433
16:50.080 --> 16:51.210
more than anything.

434
16:51.240 --> 16:52.440
File a complaint if you want.

435
16:52.440 --> 16:53.120
I don't care.

436
16:53.120 --> 16:54.920
Who's a regional bigot now? I...

437
16:56.150 --> 16:58.080
I was also born in the Northeast, sir.

438
16:58.080 --> 16:59.440
Once I refuse to serve, you're

439
16:59.440 --> 17:00.910
suddenly a Northeasterner?

440
17:00.910 --> 17:01.960
Trying to buddy up with me, huh?

441
17:01.960 --> 17:04.310
-Get out of my car now. -I really don't have time for this fuss.

442
17:04.310 --> 17:05.069
I'm in a real hurry.

443
17:05.069 --> 17:06.270
I'm going to miss my train.

444
17:06.270 --> 17:07.400
Can you just drive?

445
17:07.680 --> 17:08.550
You think I'd care?

446
17:08.550 --> 17:09.680
Get out of my car now.

447
17:09.880 --> 17:11.010
I'm ending the ride.

448
17:14.069 --> 17:15.000
Get a move on!

449
17:31.350 --> 17:32.680
Is that her ex-husband?

450
17:44.510 --> 17:46.240
Did you go traveling or were you

451
17:46.480 --> 17:47.720
fleeing from a famine?

452
17:47.720 --> 17:49.440
I went traveling, of course.

453
17:50.240 --> 17:52.840
But it was worse than fleeing a famine at first.

454
17:53.720 --> 17:55.200
I made a trip to Jiagedaqi

455
17:55.720 --> 17:58.200
and got lost in the Greater Khingan Mountains.

456
17:58.200 --> 17:59.000
Wait. So...

457
17:59.310 --> 18:00.830
you got lost while traveling?

458
18:00.830 --> 18:01.920
Really?

459
18:02.070 --> 18:03.870
Why would I lie to you about that?

460
18:04.960 --> 18:07.090
I brought you some local specialties.

461
18:07.750 --> 18:08.830
Hey, Huang,

462
18:08.880 --> 18:10.080
deer antlers for you.

463
18:10.680 --> 18:11.480
You...

464
18:11.720 --> 18:12.310
Well...

465
18:12.310 --> 18:12.880
You...

466
18:12.880 --> 18:14.350
These are very nutritional.

467
18:14.350 --> 18:16.400
Why squander your money on these?

468
18:16.680 --> 18:17.750
I have plenty of money.

469
18:17.750 --> 18:20.160
These can lower blood pressure. Good stuff.

470
18:20.160 --> 18:21.360
Where is Zhengliang?

471
18:21.510 --> 18:23.110
He has gone back to the South.

472
18:23.790 --> 18:24.550
So he eventually went back.

473
18:24.550 --> 18:25.550
Yes, he did.

474
18:26.310 --> 18:27.480
Then I'll give this to you.

475
18:27.480 --> 18:28.680
It's also great stuff.

476
18:28.680 --> 18:30.140
From the wilderness, too.

477
18:31.070 --> 18:31.310
Thanks.

478
18:31.310 --> 18:33.680
I thought I was definitely going to die back then.

479
18:33.680 --> 18:35.750
Later on, an Ewenki named Xiwen

480
18:35.750 --> 18:37.030
saved my life.

481
18:37.270 --> 18:38.720
I spent half a month there.

482
18:38.720 --> 18:39.960
It felt amazing.

483
18:43.310 --> 18:44.550
Cheers, Meng.

484
18:51.240 --> 18:53.920
-Loosen your grip. -Then prop it up, right?

485
18:53.920 --> 18:54.720
Yes, release.

486
18:55.240 --> 18:55.790
Right.

487
18:56.400 --> 18:56.920
Correct.

488
18:56.920 --> 18:58.640
I got the hang of it.

489
19:06.070 --> 19:07.130
For the first time,

490
19:07.200 --> 19:09.920
I realized that I had such close bonds

491
19:09.960 --> 19:11.160
with nature, the forest,

492
19:11.160 --> 19:12.750
and all kinds of animals.

493
19:13.110 --> 19:15.000
I even learned how to raise reindeer.

494
19:15.000 --> 19:16.270
Why? Did they fight you for food?

495
19:16.270 --> 19:17.730
Why else are you so hungry?

496
19:20.720 --> 19:23.250
Because I couldn't eat anything on the train.

497
19:23.400 --> 19:25.200
I got used to the food in the mountains,

498
19:25.200 --> 19:28.460
and couldn't bring myself to eat instant noodles anymore.

499
19:31.440 --> 19:32.310
I came back

500
19:33.590 --> 19:35.270
to deal with two major issues.

501
19:35.550 --> 19:36.440
First,

502
19:36.680 --> 19:37.810
I'm going to resign.

503
19:38.030 --> 19:39.510
The town at the foot of the mountain where Xiwen lives

504
19:39.510 --> 19:40.550
is short of doctors.

505
19:40.550 --> 19:42.110
I plan to settle down there.

506
19:42.110 --> 19:42.830
What?

507
19:43.200 --> 19:45.930
You're moving to the Greater Khingan Mountains?

508
19:46.680 --> 19:49.030
In the past, I only cared about making money,

509
19:49.030 --> 19:50.720
which invisibly added

510
19:51.070 --> 19:53.200
much meaningless pressure on myself.

511
19:54.030 --> 19:55.680
I even saw you and your father

512
19:55.920 --> 19:57.650
as burdens that slowed me down.

513
19:58.640 --> 20:00.440
But now I understand, Mingming.

514
20:00.640 --> 20:02.310
Huang, I understand now.

515
20:02.310 --> 20:03.440
Oh, you understand.

516
20:04.270 --> 20:05.070
Mingming,

517
20:05.680 --> 20:07.270
I apologize to you

518
20:07.270 --> 20:07.960
for what I said

519
20:07.960 --> 20:08.920
and did before.

520
20:10.440 --> 20:11.440
I'm sorry.

521
20:13.350 --> 20:14.640
No need to apologize.

522
20:14.750 --> 20:15.880
It's all in the past.

523
20:16.160 --> 20:17.200
We're already divorced.

524
20:17.200 --> 20:18.270
We don't owe each other anything.

525
20:18.270 --> 20:19.130
Oh, about that!

526
20:22.160 --> 20:24.200
The second major issue I came back for...

527
20:24.200 --> 20:25.000
What is it?

528
20:26.920 --> 20:28.200
Let me finish. Let me.

529
20:29.310 --> 20:30.910
That is, I'm remarrying you.

530
20:33.200 --> 20:34.600
Let's go there together.

531
20:35.030 --> 20:36.230
What did you just say?

532
20:37.200 --> 20:38.200
You can't have

533
20:38.200 --> 20:39.590
a real life anywhere else.

534
20:39.590 --> 20:40.920
Go and see for yourself.

535
20:41.270 --> 20:42.530
It's wonderful there.

536
20:43.720 --> 20:44.480
Really.

537
20:45.960 --> 20:47.960
L-Let go of my hands now.

538
20:48.400 --> 20:49.880
F-Finish your food first.

539
20:50.680 --> 20:52.110
-We'll talk later. -Okay.

540
20:52.110 --> 20:54.310
Let's tell your father when we get home.

541
21:00.110 --> 21:01.910
You can't imagine how beautiful

542
21:02.350 --> 21:03.680
that large body of water

543
21:04.400 --> 21:05.730
and those reindeer are.

544
21:06.110 --> 21:08.270
That's the life everyone yearns for!

545
21:10.070 --> 21:11.790
Please hold on tight and stand firm.

546
21:11.790 --> 21:14.400
Hold the handrail tightly and watch your step.

547
21:14.440 --> 21:15.920
Do not look at your phone.

548
21:16.200 --> 21:17.680
Passengers with large luggage

549
21:17.680 --> 21:19.160
and strollers,

550
21:19.640 --> 21:21.880
please do not use the escalator.

551
21:23.160 --> 21:24.310
A suspicious man spotted in the underpass.

552
21:24.310 --> 21:25.440
Requesting backup.

553
21:26.000 --> 21:26.790
Hold on!

554
21:27.350 --> 21:27.880
Stop!

555
21:27.920 --> 21:28.590
Stop there!

556
21:28.680 --> 21:29.610
Hold on for a sec.

557
21:32.270 --> 21:34.200
How did you get so much blood on you?

558
21:35.680 --> 21:37.270
I-I'm a doctor.

559
21:37.510 --> 21:39.160
I got this blood on me

560
21:39.160 --> 21:40.350
when delivering a baby.

561
21:40.350 --> 21:42.510
[Happy New Year]

562
21:40.550 --> 21:41.480
You're a doctor?

563
21:41.590 --> 21:42.590
Which hospital do you work in?

564
21:42.590 --> 21:43.920
Xiaoximen Hospital...

565
21:44.790 --> 21:46.920
I mean, Fuzhou Kangtaierke Hospital.

566
21:47.350 --> 21:48.750
You're saying a doctor from Fuzhou

567
21:48.750 --> 21:49.510
came all the way here

568
21:49.510 --> 21:50.750
to Bengbu to deliver a baby?

569
21:50.750 --> 21:51.110
No.

570
21:51.310 --> 21:52.160
Officer,

571
21:52.350 --> 21:53.640
it was a rather complicated situation.

572
21:53.640 --> 21:54.640
A true emergency.

573
21:54.680 --> 21:56.160
When I was riding a train,

574
21:56.510 --> 21:57.350
a pregnant woman

575
21:57.350 --> 21:58.030
was about to give birth,

576
21:58.030 --> 21:59.630
so I helped deliver the baby.

577
22:01.640 --> 22:02.790
Do doctors nowadays

578
22:02.790 --> 22:04.450
not wear white coats anymore?

579
22:04.680 --> 22:05.720
You got blood all over your coat,

580
22:05.720 --> 22:06.590
and you didn't even get changed?

581
22:06.590 --> 22:07.400
Show me your ID now.

582
22:07.400 --> 22:08.240
I wish I could get changed,

583
22:08.240 --> 22:09.160
but my luggage

584
22:09.160 --> 22:09.720
and all my stuff

585
22:09.720 --> 22:10.680
was on that train.

586
22:10.680 --> 22:11.310
It left.

587
22:11.310 --> 22:12.830
I'm going to the train station now.

588
22:12.830 --> 22:13.960
Show me your ID, now!

589
22:15.350 --> 22:16.160
Fine.

590
22:16.640 --> 22:18.030
P-Please, don't get all worked up.

591
22:18.030 --> 22:19.030
I'm reaching for it.

592
22:19.030 --> 22:19.960
I have my ID on me.

593
22:22.350 --> 22:23.880
Where's my wallet?

594
22:24.550 --> 22:25.200
Hold still!

595
22:25.200 --> 22:25.640
No.

596
22:25.640 --> 22:26.200
Don't move!

597
22:26.200 --> 22:27.590
-I lost my wallet. -Halt!

598
22:27.590 --> 22:28.790
M-My wallet...

599
22:28.790 --> 22:29.920
My wallet is gone.

600
22:29.920 --> 22:30.510
My wallet...

601
22:30.510 --> 22:31.030
Don't move!

602
22:31.030 --> 22:32.430
My ID is in my wallet!

603
22:33.830 --> 22:35.200
My ID is in my wallet!

604
22:35.400 --> 22:37.510
I-I am a good person!

605
22:38.440 --> 22:39.480
I'm a doctor!

606
22:39.750 --> 22:41.270
I'm calling the police!

607
22:40.770 --> 22:44.270
[Police]

608
22:46.060 --> 22:50.170
[Police]

609
22:48.440 --> 22:49.830
It was truly a mistake.

610
22:50.170 --> 22:56.360
[Police Duty Office of Bengbu Railway Station]

611
22:50.400 --> 22:51.240
A mistake.

612
22:51.240 --> 22:51.920
Are you sure?

613
22:51.920 --> 22:52.680
Yes.

614
22:52.830 --> 22:53.590
They explained to me.

615
22:53.590 --> 22:54.850
I've sorted it all out.

616
22:58.070 --> 22:58.880
Mr. Liu,

617
23:00.030 --> 23:01.400
sorry about what happened.

618
23:01.400 --> 23:02.330
It was a mistake.

619
23:02.640 --> 23:04.270
You did do a good deed

620
23:04.350 --> 23:05.830
and help other passengers.

621
23:05.830 --> 23:06.350
Yes, yes.

622
23:06.350 --> 23:08.350
That's why you were thrown off your schedule.

623
23:08.350 --> 23:09.640
Our supervisor made an exception

624
23:09.640 --> 23:10.960
and proposed to buy you

625
23:10.960 --> 23:12.090
a ticket to Nanjing.

626
23:12.110 --> 23:12.920
It's free of charge.

627
23:12.920 --> 23:14.070
Yes, free of charge.

628
23:14.070 --> 23:15.800
This matter is not about money.

629
23:16.480 --> 23:18.160
It's not about train tickets either.

630
23:18.160 --> 23:19.440
Aren't you a police officer?

631
23:19.440 --> 23:20.970
Just help me find my wallet.

632
23:21.030 --> 23:21.790
Oh my goodness.

633
23:21.790 --> 23:22.480
Mr. Liu,

634
23:22.480 --> 23:23.480
think about it.

635
23:23.480 --> 23:24.680
Your wallet was left behind in a taxi,

636
23:24.680 --> 23:26.310
which you hailed randomly on the street.

637
23:26.310 --> 23:27.270
And you didn't get

638
23:27.270 --> 23:28.350
a receipt from the driver.

639
23:28.350 --> 23:29.240
Besides, there's no

640
23:29.240 --> 23:30.510
electronic payment record.

641
23:30.510 --> 23:32.570
How am I supposed to find your wallet?

642
23:33.510 --> 23:34.270
Look at that.

643
23:34.270 --> 23:35.790
Pull the surveillance footage.

644
23:35.790 --> 23:36.880
There are surveillance cameras

645
23:36.880 --> 23:38.400
everywhere, staying on 24/7.

646
23:38.400 --> 23:39.440
Yeah, right.

647
23:39.480 --> 23:42.140
But it takes time to find it through the footage.

648
23:42.510 --> 23:43.750
How about this?

649
23:44.790 --> 23:46.480
Leave your contact info with us.

650
23:46.480 --> 23:47.110
We'll let you know

651
23:47.110 --> 23:48.570
when your wallet is found.

652
23:48.640 --> 23:49.440
Is it okay?

653
23:50.790 --> 23:52.000
That'll work.

654
23:55.920 --> 23:57.720
Then what about my luggage on the train?

655
23:57.720 --> 23:58.920
Have you found it yet?

656
23:59.160 --> 24:00.440
Don't worry about that.

657
24:00.440 --> 24:01.310
I've confirmed with

658
24:01.310 --> 24:02.110
the train conductor.

659
24:02.110 --> 24:02.720
Your mother already

660
24:02.720 --> 24:03.960
collected your luggage.

661
24:03.960 --> 24:04.750
Who?

662
24:04.960 --> 24:05.880
Your mother.

663
24:10.790 --> 24:11.590
My mother...

664
24:13.310 --> 24:14.240
She passed long ago.

665
24:14.240 --> 24:16.110
How could she have collected my luggage?

666
24:16.110 --> 24:17.920
W-What kind of confirmation is that?

667
24:17.920 --> 24:18.680
But

668
24:18.680 --> 24:20.240
this is what I was told.

669
24:20.240 --> 24:20.920
Look.

670
24:21.440 --> 24:23.110
It's a woman in her sixties,

671
24:23.110 --> 24:23.680
who

672
24:23.680 --> 24:24.960
shared a bunk with you.

673
24:25.240 --> 24:26.440
I don't know her.

674
24:26.440 --> 24:27.640
She's not my mother.

675
24:30.030 --> 24:31.160
What a mess.

676
24:31.640 --> 24:33.160
Maybe she was just being nice and offered

677
24:33.160 --> 24:34.440
to watch over your stuff.

678
24:34.440 --> 24:34.750
Yeah.

679
24:34.750 --> 24:35.400
Think hard.

680
24:35.400 --> 24:36.270
Perhaps there was

681
24:36.270 --> 24:37.590
some sort of mistake.

682
24:39.480 --> 24:40.110
Don't fret.

683
24:40.110 --> 24:41.160
Don't worry.

684
24:41.310 --> 24:43.030
Yeah, think about it carefully.

685
24:43.030 --> 24:43.880
Officers,

686
24:44.070 --> 24:45.680
I'm not fretting.

687
24:46.240 --> 24:47.070
It's just that my luggage

688
24:47.070 --> 24:48.270
is really important.

689
24:48.830 --> 24:49.790
Sorry.

690
24:49.790 --> 24:51.120
We're not of help to you.

691
24:51.350 --> 24:52.790
But we'll try to get in contact

692
24:52.790 --> 24:55.120
with this older woman as soon as possible.

693
24:56.590 --> 24:57.310
How about this?

694
24:57.310 --> 24:58.110
You buy me a ticket

695
24:58.110 --> 24:59.350
to Fuzhou.

696
24:59.920 --> 25:01.030
When the luggage is retrieved,

697
25:01.030 --> 25:02.030
send it to me.

698
25:02.720 --> 25:03.400
Then...

699
25:03.400 --> 25:05.060
when would you like to set out?

700
25:06.550 --> 25:08.310
Someone will pick me up in Fuzhou.

701
25:08.310 --> 25:08.920
B-But I...

702
25:08.920 --> 25:09.920
I need to ask them

703
25:10.240 --> 25:10.920
about the exact time.

704
25:10.920 --> 25:11.850
I'll make a call.

705
25:12.270 --> 25:12.880
Okay.

706
25:13.000 --> 25:14.270
Alright. I'll make the call outside.

707
25:14.270 --> 25:15.730
Just don't worry, Mr. Liu.

708
25:17.070 --> 25:17.720
What went wrong?

709
25:17.720 --> 25:18.590
His mother is dead.

710
25:18.590 --> 25:20.390
Who told you she got his luggage?

711
25:28.350 --> 25:29.270
Who's calling?

712
25:30.110 --> 25:30.790
A doctor

713
25:30.790 --> 25:32.200
who's on his way to join us.

714
25:32.200 --> 25:33.160
In fact, I don't know him.

715
25:33.160 --> 25:34.550
It's President Hong's arrangement.

716
25:34.550 --> 25:35.550
Answer the phone.

717
25:35.640 --> 25:36.350
Put it on speaker.

718
25:36.350 --> 25:37.000
Okay.

719
25:39.440 --> 25:40.110
Hello?

720
25:40.590 --> 25:41.720
Secretary Ni?

721
25:42.160 --> 25:42.830
It's me.

722
25:42.920 --> 25:44.400
I'm Liu Zhengliang.

723
25:44.880 --> 25:45.750
We talked to each other

724
25:45.750 --> 25:46.720
previously.

725
25:46.920 --> 25:47.880
I'm the doctor coming from

726
25:47.880 --> 25:49.350
the Northeast to join the hospital.

727
25:49.350 --> 25:50.240
I remember you.

728
25:50.240 --> 25:51.640
You're arriving tomorrow, right?

729
25:51.520 --> 25:58.730
[Happy New Year]

730
25:51.640 --> 25:52.270
Yes.

731
25:52.680 --> 25:54.270
I was just getting to that.

732
25:54.480 --> 25:55.400
Well, I...

733
25:55.790 --> 25:56.590
I...

734
25:56.830 --> 25:57.960
I had a little problem on the way.

735
25:57.960 --> 25:59.890
Now, I'm officially informing you

736
25:59.960 --> 26:01.110
that you don't need to come here.

737
26:01.110 --> 26:01.960
Yeah, right.

738
26:02.070 --> 26:02.750
I don't think

739
26:02.750 --> 26:04.200
I can reach the hospital tomorrow.

740
26:04.200 --> 26:05.000
I guess I won't

741
26:05.000 --> 26:06.160
be there until the day

742
26:06.160 --> 26:07.750
after tomorrow at the earliest.

743
26:07.750 --> 26:08.480
No, no, no.

744
26:08.510 --> 26:09.720
I mean

745
26:09.750 --> 26:11.070
you don't need to come

746
26:11.070 --> 26:12.160
to Fuzhou at all.

747
26:13.550 --> 26:14.480
What's that now?

748
26:15.000 --> 26:16.200
It was Hong Bin who told you

749
26:16.200 --> 26:17.240
to come for a visit

750
26:17.240 --> 26:18.640
and join the crew, right?

751
26:20.440 --> 26:22.000
I was recommended

752
26:22.030 --> 26:23.400
by my former supervisor.

753
26:23.400 --> 26:24.510
He said President Hong

754
26:24.510 --> 26:25.680
was a school mate of his.

755
26:25.680 --> 26:27.480
Hong Bin is now under investigation

756
26:27.480 --> 26:28.350
for suspected

757
26:28.680 --> 26:30.270
embezzlement and accepting bribes.

758
26:30.270 --> 26:31.640
He is no longer the president

759
26:31.640 --> 26:32.570
of our hospital.

760
26:33.270 --> 26:33.920
And now

761
26:33.920 --> 26:35.440
we can't offer you a job.

762
26:35.440 --> 26:35.880
So

763
26:35.880 --> 26:37.070
you'll have to try your luck

764
26:37.070 --> 26:37.830
with another hospital.

765
26:37.830 --> 26:38.200
No, no.

766
26:38.200 --> 26:39.440
Wait a minute. Wait.

767
26:40.750 --> 26:42.150
Let me comb this through.

768
26:42.640 --> 26:43.640
Let me sort it out.

769
26:46.160 --> 26:46.960
Secretary Ni.

770
26:47.960 --> 26:48.750
Listen,

771
26:49.270 --> 26:51.030
I set out from the Northeast.

772
26:51.510 --> 26:53.440
I've been on the train for two days.

773
26:53.750 --> 26:54.920
At the moment, I'm in a bind

774
26:54.920 --> 26:56.250
and stranded in Bengbu.

775
26:56.270 --> 26:57.070
All my luggage

776
26:57.070 --> 26:58.510
is on the previous train.

777
26:58.510 --> 26:59.310
Thank you for calling.

778
26:59.310 --> 27:00.680
Have a nice trip then.

779
27:00.680 --> 27:02.030
What nice trip?

780
27:02.030 --> 27:03.160
There's nothing...

781
27:04.640 --> 27:06.030
Mr. Liu! Mr. Liu.

782
27:06.310 --> 27:07.070
I spoke

783
27:07.070 --> 27:08.200
with my supervisor.

784
27:08.200 --> 27:09.310
He agreed to buy you

785
27:09.310 --> 27:10.440
a ticket to Fuzhou.

786
27:10.640 --> 27:12.300
When would you like to set out?

787
27:12.790 --> 27:13.310
No.

788
27:13.350 --> 27:15.010
Well, can you give me a second?

789
27:15.310 --> 27:16.570
Things are a bit messy.

790
27:17.070 --> 27:18.790
I-I need to sort them out.

791
27:18.790 --> 27:19.480
Look,

792
27:19.750 --> 27:20.790
I'll make one more call.

793
27:20.790 --> 27:21.720
Give me a moment.

794
27:21.760 --> 27:23.970
[Conference Room]

795
27:24.160 --> 27:26.860
[Liu Zhengliang]

796
27:26.940 --> 27:31.550
[Healing pain with compassion, lighting up hope with dedication]

797
27:28.350 --> 27:29.200
Well done!

798
27:29.790 --> 27:31.270
That caught me off guard.

799
27:32.920 --> 27:34.320
Please dial again later.

800
27:35.320 --> 27:37.820
[Police Office of Bengbu Railway Station]

801
27:40.550 --> 27:42.690
[Police]

802
27:43.070 --> 27:43.920
Good job!

803
27:45.070 --> 27:46.200
That was a topspin loop.

804
27:46.200 --> 27:47.070
[Liu Zhengliang]

805
27:47.420 --> 27:49.870
[Missed call] [Liu Zhengliang]

806
27:49.930 --> 27:54.760
[Police]

807
27:54.720 --> 27:56.350
That smash you did looked just like

808
27:54.840 --> 28:04.620
[Healing pain with compassion, lighting up hope with dedication]

809
27:56.350 --> 27:57.030
Ma Long's.

810
27:57.160 --> 27:57.790
I'm exhausted.

811
27:57.790 --> 27:58.830
D-Drink this.

812
27:58.830 --> 27:59.510
No, I'd rather not.

813
27:59.510 --> 28:00.270
After exercise,

814
28:00.270 --> 28:01.200
you should drink this.

815
28:01.200 --> 28:01.640
Let me wipe my sweat.

816
28:01.640 --> 28:03.370
It replenishes electrolytes.

817
28:04.590 --> 28:05.400
Oh you.

818
28:05.510 --> 28:07.710
You don't have to let me win every point.

819
28:07.830 --> 28:08.590
I d-didn't...

820
28:08.590 --> 28:10.070
So you saw it through?

821
28:10.440 --> 28:11.900
I didn't really hold back.

822
28:11.920 --> 28:13.000
I certainly saw it through.

823
28:13.000 --> 28:15.200
Or your efforts would be in vain, right?

824
28:15.350 --> 28:17.200
I just wanted to cheer you up.

825
28:17.510 --> 28:18.270
You've been working

826
28:18.270 --> 28:19.920
hard and under too much pressure.

827
28:19.920 --> 28:21.000
You need to relax.

828
28:21.030 --> 28:22.830
Why would you want to cheer me up?

829
28:23.310 --> 28:24.110
You were pleasing me.

830
28:24.110 --> 28:25.640
What is your real purpose?

831
28:25.640 --> 28:26.240
No, nothing.

832
28:26.240 --> 28:27.110
You want to be the vice president?

833
28:27.110 --> 28:27.830
No, I don't.

834
28:27.830 --> 28:29.110
I'm not qualified for it.

835
28:29.110 --> 28:29.920
I'm not.

836
28:32.790 --> 28:33.880
You're up for the job.

837
28:33.880 --> 28:34.830
I am not.

838
28:34.830 --> 28:35.510
I'm absolutely not.

839
28:35.510 --> 28:37.040
I'm sure you'll do a good job

840
28:37.270 --> 28:38.350
If you take the position.

841
28:38.350 --> 28:39.510
No, I'm not up for it.

842
28:39.550 --> 28:40.830
You're best suited to play

843
28:40.830 --> 28:42.240
the role of the wise leader.

844
28:42.240 --> 28:43.030
You are meant

845
28:43.070 --> 28:43.960
to be the leader.

846
28:43.960 --> 28:45.090
I'm feeling so good.

847
28:45.680 --> 28:46.790
Get me my coat.

848
28:47.480 --> 28:48.920
I'm sweating all over. Better not catch a cold.

849
28:48.920 --> 28:49.790
That's right.

850
28:50.960 --> 28:52.490
You've really worked hard.

851
28:53.550 --> 28:55.030
Let me give you a massage.

852
28:57.030 --> 28:58.160
In such a short while,

853
28:58.160 --> 28:59.690
I missed more than 10 calls.

854
29:02.510 --> 29:03.880
Guess who made them.

855
29:04.510 --> 29:05.310
I...

856
29:05.440 --> 29:06.110
Definitely

857
29:06.110 --> 29:07.240
not your wife.

858
29:07.750 --> 29:08.640
If it were her,

859
29:08.640 --> 29:09.970
you wouldn't be so calm.

860
29:11.200 --> 29:12.400
It's Liu Zhengliang.

861
29:13.880 --> 29:14.590
What's with him?

862
29:14.590 --> 29:16.390
Why did he give you so many calls?

863
29:18.160 --> 29:19.360
I'm calling him back.

864
29:20.720 --> 29:21.720
I-I-I am

865
29:22.070 --> 29:22.870
leaving then.

866
29:31.530 --> 29:37.430
[Police Office of Bengbu Railway Station]

867
29:37.030 --> 29:37.550
Hello.

868
29:37.920 --> 29:39.920
You called me, didn't you?

869
29:40.320 --> 29:44.750
[Police]

870
29:40.440 --> 29:42.170
The hospital you referred me to

871
29:42.440 --> 29:43.480
won't hire me now.

872
29:43.720 --> 29:44.720
What should I do?

873
29:45.160 --> 29:46.220
Who won't hire you?

874
29:46.550 --> 29:48.680
Just the person you told me to contact.

875
29:50.550 --> 29:51.550
You mean Hong Bin?

876
29:52.240 --> 29:53.790
No, his secretary.

877
29:54.270 --> 29:55.400
This man said Hong Bin was arrested

878
29:55.400 --> 29:56.110
for corruption and bribery.

879
29:56.110 --> 29:57.110
Really?

880
29:58.640 --> 29:59.970
What should you do then?

881
30:01.030 --> 30:02.110
You're asking me?

882
30:02.640 --> 30:04.200
I should be the one asking you.

883
30:04.200 --> 30:05.270
How could you introduce someone

884
30:05.270 --> 30:06.400
so unreliable to me?

885
30:08.200 --> 30:09.000
Wait.

886
30:09.720 --> 30:10.510
You see,

887
30:11.720 --> 30:14.240
there was never a problem throughout Hong Bin's

888
30:14.240 --> 30:14.880
career.

889
30:14.880 --> 30:15.680
But the moment

890
30:16.110 --> 30:17.110
you showed up, he was

891
30:17.060 --> 30:21.320
[Police]

892
30:17.110 --> 30:18.550
brought down abruptly. How come?

893
30:18.550 --> 30:19.880
What do you mean by that?

894
30:19.920 --> 30:21.440
Are you saying this is my fault?

895
30:21.440 --> 30:22.350
No, it's not your fault.

896
30:22.350 --> 30:23.590
I'm just concerned and worried

897
30:23.590 --> 30:24.680
about you, aren't I?

898
30:24.680 --> 30:26.000
Cut the crap.

899
30:24.850 --> 30:32.890
[Police]

900
30:26.550 --> 30:27.750
I'm telling you, I...

901
30:28.440 --> 30:30.110
I'm in an awkward situation now.

902
30:30.110 --> 30:31.770
Utterly and sheerly awkward.

903
30:31.880 --> 30:33.240
You have to take full responsibility, don't you?

904
30:33.240 --> 30:35.510
Full responsibility? Why is it all on me?

905
30:36.110 --> 30:36.960
How about this?

906
30:36.960 --> 30:38.310
Just come back here.

907
30:39.550 --> 30:42.810
[Police]

908
30:39.590 --> 30:41.310
I'm not going back, I'm telling you.

909
30:41.310 --> 30:43.070
I'd sooner be dead than back there.

910
30:43.070 --> 30:44.960
At worst, I'll just find a job right here.

911
30:44.960 --> 30:45.590
You think

912
30:45.590 --> 30:46.990
I can't find a job or what?

913
30:47.480 --> 30:48.610
Oh, Liu Zhengliang.

914
30:50.510 --> 30:51.240
Mr. Liu,

915
30:51.350 --> 30:51.960
I got you

916
30:51.960 --> 30:52.590
a coat of mine.

917
30:52.590 --> 30:53.720
Why not get changed?

918
30:58.070 --> 30:58.960
Mr. Liu.

919
30:59.590 --> 31:01.510
No need to smell it. It's been washed.

920
31:01.510 --> 31:02.310
Mr. Liu.

921
31:03.480 --> 31:04.270
Have you decided

922
31:04.270 --> 31:05.200
when to leave?

923
31:09.640 --> 31:11.640
I-I am still waiting for your reply.

924
31:14.680 --> 31:15.790
It sounded to me that Liu Zhengliang

925
31:15.790 --> 31:16.550
got a problem

926
31:16.550 --> 31:17.750
out there, didn't he?

927
31:17.960 --> 31:18.760
It's my fault.

928
31:19.750 --> 31:21.350
I referred him to a hospital,

929
31:21.350 --> 31:23.010
but it later ran into trouble.

930
31:24.270 --> 31:25.000
Then what to do with it?

931
31:25.000 --> 31:26.350
We must quickly come up with a solution.

932
31:26.350 --> 31:26.790
Talk him into...

933
31:26.790 --> 31:27.850
Talk him into what?

934
31:28.350 --> 31:29.680
He refused to come back.

935
31:29.750 --> 31:30.880
Didn't you just ask him

936
31:30.880 --> 31:32.070
to come back here?

937
31:32.070 --> 31:32.880
He should come back.

938
31:32.880 --> 31:33.640
Our hospital is great.

939
31:33.640 --> 31:35.300
These things can't be forced.

940
31:35.440 --> 31:36.480
We are already

941
31:36.480 --> 31:37.680
in trouble ourselves.

942
31:37.680 --> 31:39.410
How are we supposed to help him?

943
31:43.310 --> 31:44.000
During

944
31:44.480 --> 31:46.000
t-the meeting on Monday,

945
31:46.000 --> 31:48.730
did someone propose to disband Xiaoximen again?

946
31:52.240 --> 31:53.640
They are the knife,

947
31:53.920 --> 31:54.720
but I, Long Dongdong, am

948
31:54.720 --> 31:56.310
no chopping block.

949
32:05.200 --> 32:06.400
Eat it while it's hot.

950
32:14.440 --> 32:15.370
Coming right up!

951
32:18.030 --> 32:18.830
Who is it?

952
32:22.550 --> 32:23.750
Why did you come here?

953
32:24.310 --> 32:25.590
I brought you two something extra

954
32:25.590 --> 32:26.510
to eat—a pizza.

955
32:27.510 --> 32:28.720
Well, this is not a good time.

956
32:28.720 --> 32:29.400
Why don't you

957
32:29.400 --> 32:30.240
keep it for yourself?

958
32:30.240 --> 32:31.830
Comrade Changhai. Comrade Changhai!

959
32:31.830 --> 32:33.350
-Take it back and share it with others. -Do you remember me?

960
32:33.350 --> 32:34.410
Comrade Changhai?

961
32:35.400 --> 32:36.530
Commissioner Chen.

962
32:37.550 --> 32:38.350
I waited a long time for you.

963
32:38.350 --> 32:40.200
-Let's go inside. -Better eat this while it's hot!

964
32:40.200 --> 32:40.920
Did you have a safe journey?

965
32:40.920 --> 32:41.830
Yes, very safe.

966
32:41.830 --> 32:43.240
-Hello. -No one was tailing you, right?

967
32:43.240 --> 32:43.750
No one.

968
32:43.830 --> 32:44.510
Don't you worry.

969
32:44.510 --> 32:44.790
Good.

970
32:44.790 --> 32:46.450
Everything's well arranged.

971
32:47.680 --> 32:48.550
You even brought something over.

972
32:48.550 --> 32:49.750
Oh, look at this.

973
32:51.030 --> 32:52.640
How did you know I enjoy pizza?

974
32:52.640 --> 32:53.480
Because it's tasty.

975
32:53.480 --> 32:54.810
Mingming enjoys it too.

976
32:57.640 --> 32:58.680
So much cheese.

977
32:59.960 --> 33:01.960
To keep up with the fast pace of life,

978
33:02.030 --> 33:04.200
urban residents like to

979
33:04.880 --> 33:06.010
fill their stomachs

980
33:06.070 --> 33:07.680
with highly processed food like this.

981
33:07.680 --> 33:09.010
It's not healthy at all.

982
33:09.270 --> 33:11.510
-Awful. -If you can't stand it, just leave.

983
33:11.510 --> 33:12.920
No, bro, you don't get it.

984
33:12.960 --> 33:13.830
Some people like

985
33:13.830 --> 33:15.400
to wrap the meat filling inside,

986
33:15.400 --> 33:16.440
but Uncle Che here

987
33:16.880 --> 33:18.590
likes the meat filling to show.

988
33:18.590 --> 33:19.750
It's chewy in the mouth,

989
33:19.750 --> 33:21.070
and smells good on the outside.

990
33:21.070 --> 33:22.030
Delicious, isn't it?

991
33:22.030 --> 33:22.510
Yes, it is.

992
33:22.510 --> 33:23.960
I noticed that last time

993
33:23.960 --> 33:24.720
I ate it.

994
33:24.720 --> 33:25.510
Oh, you.

995
33:26.480 --> 33:27.270
Have some more if you think

996
33:27.270 --> 33:27.870
it's good.

997
33:28.030 --> 33:30.640
We used to be married, and that left us a lasting bond.

998
33:30.640 --> 33:32.000
Now, I have found

999
33:32.000 --> 33:33.400
the true meaning of life.

1000
33:33.640 --> 33:35.240
I have the obligation, the responsibility,

1001
33:35.240 --> 33:36.160
and the capability

1002
33:36.160 --> 33:38.220
to get you out of misery along with me.

1003
33:41.240 --> 33:42.790
You're choking. Don't eat so fast.

1004
33:42.790 --> 33:44.000
If you can't stand it either,

1005
33:44.000 --> 33:44.790
just leave.

1006
33:46.000 --> 33:47.830
I choked on my own saliva.

1007
33:47.830 --> 33:48.720
I just chocked.

1008
33:50.110 --> 33:51.240
Get me some tissues.

1009
33:52.200 --> 33:54.460
How about you stay in the room for a while?

1010
33:55.680 --> 33:56.810
Commissioner Chen.

1011
33:57.200 --> 33:57.880
I don't think

1012
33:57.880 --> 33:59.070
this is a good place to talk.

1013
33:59.070 --> 33:59.680
It is high time

1014
33:59.680 --> 34:01.280
we changed our meeting spot.

1015
34:01.510 --> 34:02.640
Uncle Che, no rush.

1016
34:03.030 --> 34:03.750
Wait a moment.

1017
34:03.750 --> 34:05.010
Wait a moment for what?

1018
34:05.200 --> 34:06.030
Aren't you here

1019
34:06.030 --> 34:07.560
to meet my father in secret?

1020
34:09.550 --> 34:10.360
Uncle Che.

1021
34:11.320 --> 34:12.510
Time to change the meeting spot.

1022
34:12.510 --> 34:13.150
Let's go.

1023
34:13.190 --> 34:13.840
A change now?

1024
34:13.840 --> 34:14.570
A change now.

1025
34:15.880 --> 34:16.670
T-This...

1026
34:16.670 --> 34:17.320
Eat it in the room.

1027
34:17.320 --> 34:18.000
Won't you have a piece?

1028
34:18.000 --> 34:18.480
No, no.

1029
34:18.480 --> 34:19.070
Let's go.

1030
34:20.670 --> 34:21.190
Where?

1031
34:21.190 --> 34:22.150
Here, this way.

1032
34:22.639 --> 34:23.880
[Restricted area; Authorized personnel only]

1033
34:25.920 --> 34:26.380
Come on.

1034
34:29.320 --> 34:30.580
In light of the current

1035
34:30.920 --> 34:31.980
urgent situation,

1036
34:32.320 --> 34:33.840
we must send a distress signal

1037
34:33.840 --> 34:34.840
to the headquarters.

1038
34:34.840 --> 34:35.770
Tell me about it.

1039
34:35.960 --> 34:38.489
Signal three short, three long, three short.

1040
34:38.510 --> 34:39.639
What does that mean?

1041
34:42.190 --> 34:42.790
Mingming.

1042
34:44.800 --> 34:46.440
I've planned it all out.

1043
34:47.360 --> 34:48.440
Listen to me.

1044
34:49.630 --> 34:51.400
Sell this house first.

1045
34:51.710 --> 34:53.510
Then we'll build new ones there.

1046
34:53.510 --> 34:54.320
The three of us will raise

1047
34:54.320 --> 34:55.840
seven or eight reindeer on the mountain.

1048
34:55.840 --> 34:57.590
I'll open a small clinic at the mountain foot.

1049
34:57.590 --> 34:58.840
We'll buy a pickup truck

1050
34:58.140 --> 35:02.070
[Restricted area; Authorized personnel only]

1051
34:59.190 --> 35:00.840
to transport goods for the villagers.

1052
35:00.840 --> 35:03.030
A life of comfort and respect is awaiting us.

1053
35:03.030 --> 35:04.840
Let's bid a final farewell to inner friction

1054
35:04.840 --> 35:06.110
and all the hustle and bustle.

1055
35:06.110 --> 35:06.960
Your father...

1056
35:06.960 --> 35:07.960
Our father

1057
35:07.960 --> 35:09.320
might be cured there.

1058
35:09.630 --> 35:10.760
Can you picture it?

1059
35:11.590 --> 35:12.230
When we get there,

1060
35:12.230 --> 35:13.230
you won't have to work at all.

1061
35:13.230 --> 35:14.670
I'll chop wood, make fires, and cook.

1062
35:14.670 --> 35:16.200
All the chores will be mine.

1063
35:18.070 --> 35:18.880
Hao,

1064
35:20.190 --> 35:22.400
we're already divorced.

1065
35:22.840 --> 35:24.670
You and I have nothing to do with each other.

1066
35:24.670 --> 35:25.230
You just

1067
35:25.230 --> 35:27.110
live your life well.

1068
35:27.400 --> 35:28.880
And I'll be truly happy for you.

1069
35:28.880 --> 35:30.440
You don't need to worry about me and my father.

1070
35:30.440 --> 35:31.030
Okay?

1071
35:31.050 --> 35:32.690
But you have to believe me.

1072
35:33.550 --> 35:36.030
What you're living now is not a real life.

1073
35:36.030 --> 35:36.840
You are...

1074
35:37.000 --> 35:39.840
You are just making do with reality.

1075
35:49.360 --> 35:50.150
Yes.

1076
35:50.920 --> 35:52.400
My life is not that great.

1077
35:52.510 --> 35:53.480
I have to work.

1078
35:53.800 --> 35:54.930
I have to make money.

1079
35:55.190 --> 35:57.110
And I have to take care of my father.

1080
35:57.110 --> 35:58.640
The one and only dream I have

1081
35:58.920 --> 36:00.120
is to get a doctorate.

1082
36:00.800 --> 36:02.600
But I can't find a chance to do so.

1083
36:03.960 --> 36:05.560
Honestly, I really envy you.

1084
36:07.440 --> 36:08.510
You can go anywhere

1085
36:08.880 --> 36:10.190
and do anything you want.

1086
36:10.190 --> 36:11.650
So free and unrestrained.

1087
36:11.670 --> 36:13.470
It's very brave of you to forsake

1088
36:14.150 --> 36:15.550
everything for freedom.

1089
36:17.800 --> 36:18.590
But I...

1090
36:19.190 --> 36:20.840
I choose to face reality

1091
36:22.710 --> 36:24.440
and shoulder responsibility.

1092
36:24.440 --> 36:26.320
I'm still attempting to fight for

1093
36:26.320 --> 36:27.720
the dream I started with.

1094
36:28.230 --> 36:29.440
I'm also very brave,

1095
36:30.150 --> 36:30.760
aren't I?

1096
36:32.510 --> 36:34.110
Everyone has their own fate.

1097
36:34.510 --> 36:35.320
It's already

1098
36:35.480 --> 36:36.880
enough for us to live

1099
36:36.880 --> 36:37.920
our current lives

1100
36:38.320 --> 36:38.920
to the fullest.

1101
36:38.920 --> 36:40.720
No one needs to convince anyone.

1102
36:44.150 --> 36:44.960
Good.

1103
36:45.670 --> 36:46.760
Well said.

1104
36:47.840 --> 36:48.710
Mingming.

1105
36:49.880 --> 36:51.410
-You're awesome. -No, bro.

1106
36:51.590 --> 36:53.320
What do you have to do with this?

1107
36:53.800 --> 36:54.800
That's not a nice thing to say.

1108
36:54.800 --> 36:56.230
You have no idea what's going on.

1109
36:56.230 --> 36:57.360
Please be polite to him.

1110
36:57.360 --> 36:58.890
He's a co-worker in my unit.

1111
36:59.630 --> 37:00.440
Your unit?

1112
37:00.630 --> 37:01.230
Yes.

1113
37:01.630 --> 37:02.360
What unit?

1114
37:02.360 --> 37:03.420
A classified unit.

1115
37:04.480 --> 37:05.960
He was sent by Comrade Xiaobo

1116
37:05.960 --> 37:08.110
to supervise and protect me.

1117
37:08.110 --> 37:09.550
He's responsible for my safety.

1118
37:09.550 --> 37:10.480
Comrade Changhai,

1119
37:10.480 --> 37:12.150
the organization is not supervising you

1120
37:12.150 --> 37:14.150
and it trusts you unconditionally.

1121
37:14.710 --> 37:15.760
I've checked.

1122
37:16.190 --> 37:17.190
It's not serious.

1123
37:17.760 --> 37:19.160
Let's resort to surgery.

1124
37:19.360 --> 37:20.150
Doctor,

1125
37:21.130 --> 37:22.550
can I not undergo surgery?

1126
37:22.550 --> 37:24.680
You can just prescribe some medicine.

1127
37:26.230 --> 37:27.800
Given the current condition,

1128
37:27.800 --> 37:29.800
conservative treatment is possible.

1129
37:29.800 --> 37:31.110
But there is a severe narrowing

1130
37:31.110 --> 37:32.440
in your carotid artery.

1131
37:32.510 --> 37:33.910
Do you see it? Right here.

1132
37:34.360 --> 37:35.440
So I still suggest surgery.

1133
37:35.440 --> 37:36.590
Otherwise, you'll face

1134
37:36.590 --> 37:38.670
a high risk of cerebral infarction.

1135
37:38.800 --> 37:39.930
Then the surgery fee

1136
37:40.630 --> 37:41.440
must be high, right?

1137
37:41.440 --> 37:43.840
This kind of surgery is covered by medical insurance.

1138
37:43.840 --> 37:47.300
After reimbursement, you won't have to pay much out of pocket.

1139
37:47.440 --> 37:49.070
Doctor, you have no idea.

1140
37:49.280 --> 37:51.190
My son doesn't treat me well.

1141
37:51.400 --> 37:53.070
I don't want to trouble him and his wife.

1142
37:53.070 --> 37:54.400
Or my daughter-in-law

1143
37:54.400 --> 37:55.960
will accuse me of being a burden.

1144
37:55.960 --> 37:57.420
What you said is not right.

1145
37:59.630 --> 38:01.070
Who do we live for?

1146
38:02.150 --> 38:03.400
We live for ourselves,

1147
38:03.400 --> 38:04.710
not our children.

1148
38:04.710 --> 38:05.400
Yes.

1149
38:06.280 --> 38:09.010
You were so cool when you gave that little speech.

1150
38:09.110 --> 38:10.230
I was moved.

1151
38:12.480 --> 38:13.440
Focus on the driving.

1152
38:13.440 --> 38:14.840
Your car's over the line.

1153
38:14.920 --> 38:15.980
Just a dashed line.

1154
38:25.710 --> 38:26.970
Chief Physician Tong.

1155
38:29.880 --> 38:31.190
Okay, I'll tell him.

1156
38:32.880 --> 38:34.360
Got it. Alright. Bye.

1157
38:36.670 --> 38:37.230
Next Monday,

1158
38:37.230 --> 38:38.550
Chief Physician Tong will perform a surgery.

1159
38:38.550 --> 38:40.670
He asked me to be the first assistant and you the second.

1160
38:40.670 --> 38:42.400
I'll talk to the patient later.

1161
38:42.550 --> 38:43.630
Me taking part in surgery?

1162
38:43.630 --> 38:44.960
There must be a mistake.

1163
38:46.440 --> 38:47.550
Is there any other surgeon

1164
38:47.550 --> 38:48.800
in our hospital named Chen Junnan?

1165
38:48.800 --> 38:50.000
What kind of surgery?

1166
38:50.000 --> 38:51.280
Am I up for it?

1167
38:51.880 --> 38:54.510
CAS, carotid artery stenting.

1168
38:54.710 --> 38:55.840
It's not difficult.

1169
38:55.920 --> 38:58.180
Even an intern can be a second assistant.

1170
38:59.360 --> 39:01.190
What? Anything wrong?

1171
39:01.190 --> 39:02.360
Then pick an intern instead.

1172
39:02.360 --> 39:03.230
Tell Chief Physician Tong

1173
39:03.230 --> 39:04.030
not to put me on.

1174
39:04.030 --> 39:05.430
Say that to him yourself.

1175
39:06.630 --> 39:07.590
Anyway, I heard

1176
39:08.150 --> 39:09.710
Chief Physician Tong doesn't like you.

1177
39:09.710 --> 39:11.880
He's looking for an excuse to get rid of you.

1178
39:11.880 --> 39:13.740
Why don't you go test his resolve?

1179
39:15.930 --> 39:18.300
[Cosmic Squad: Epic Killings]

1180
39:23.800 --> 39:25.210
Hi, I'd like to use the internet.

1181
39:25.210 --> 39:28.660
[Article 9 Life Esports Hall]

1182
39:47.930 --> 39:50.090
[No entry for minors]

1183
39:53.880 --> 39:54.510
Anyone with pink hair

1184
39:54.510 --> 39:55.110
came in just now?

1185
39:55.110 --> 39:56.240
Lend me your jacket.

1186
39:57.710 --> 39:58.710
Who are you?

1187
39:58.760 --> 39:59.710
Bro, bro,

1188
39:59.710 --> 40:01.110
help me out.

1189
40:01.550 --> 40:02.610
Don't make a sound.

1190
40:02.960 --> 40:03.670
Thanks.

1191
40:07.290 --> 40:10.210
[The Wizard of Oz; Set out on the adventure]

1192
40:07.480 --> 40:08.480
You, check over there.

1193
40:08.480 --> 40:09.110
Okay.

1194
40:23.030 --> 40:23.550
Is he there?

1195
40:23.550 --> 40:24.150
No.

1196
40:24.800 --> 40:25.920
What a fast runner.

1197
40:26.590 --> 40:27.720
Boss, he's not here.

1198
40:29.630 --> 40:30.230
Let's go!

1199
40:50.590 --> 40:51.110
Thanks.

1200
41:08.800 --> 41:09.360
Hey.

1201
41:10.840 --> 41:12.510
Which part of town are you from?

1202
41:12.510 --> 41:14.510
How come I've never seen you before?

1203
41:15.840 --> 41:17.190
Unlike you people,

1204
41:17.360 --> 41:18.290
I'm a decent guy.

1205
41:20.190 --> 41:21.230
Has anyone ever told you

1206
41:21.230 --> 41:22.960
that you have a punchable face?

1207
41:23.710 --> 41:25.320
What a crappy computer.

1208
41:25.710 --> 41:26.480
Manager!

1209
41:31.800 --> 41:32.860
See if it works now.

1210
41:53.000 --> 41:54.510
[Resume] [Name: Liu Zhengliang]

1211
41:54.530 --> 41:57.550
[Education Background] [Work Experience]

1212
41:54.590 --> 41:55.550
Good for you.

1213
41:55.880 --> 41:57.080
You have a doctorate?

1214
41:57.960 --> 41:59.400
A medical doctor, huh.

1215
42:00.190 --> 42:01.650
Is it any of your business?

1216
42:04.190 --> 42:06.110
No, it's not.

1217
42:07.510 --> 42:09.070
As a medical doctor,

1218
42:10.630 --> 42:13.280
you're carrying a coat covered in blood while looking

1219
42:13.280 --> 42:14.810
for a job in an esports hall.

1220
42:20.110 --> 42:21.770
You truly are not faring well.

1221
42:22.190 --> 42:23.480
What's wrong with you?

1222
42:23.880 --> 42:25.140
Who's not faring well?

1223
42:26.150 --> 42:28.360
I'm just under special circumstances

1224
42:28.920 --> 42:30.920
and temporarily stranded. You know?

1225
42:30.920 --> 42:32.000
Are you even aware

1226
42:32.000 --> 42:33.000
how high in demand

1227
42:33.000 --> 42:33.840
a talent like me is,

1228
42:33.840 --> 42:34.840
little punk?

1229
42:36.440 --> 42:37.320
Yeah, right.

1230
42:37.960 --> 42:39.840
Y-You really are a talent.

1231
42:42.920 --> 42:44.450
Why am I even talking to you?

1232
42:44.800 --> 42:45.710
Go as far as you can.

1233
42:45.710 --> 42:46.230
Bother me again,

1234
42:46.230 --> 42:47.480
and I'll have that bald man come back.

1235
42:47.480 --> 42:48.230
Old-timer,

1236
42:48.960 --> 42:49.760
you see,

1237
42:49.840 --> 42:51.710
they've gone far away now.

1238
42:52.670 --> 42:53.760
You think you can scare me?

1239
42:53.760 --> 42:55.360
Who are you calling an old-timer?

1240
42:55.360 --> 42:56.110
I'm only 34.

1241
42:57.880 --> 42:59.440
I just turned 18 this year.

1242
42:59.630 --> 43:00.840
My mother's 36.

1243
43:01.710 --> 43:02.970
And you said you're 34.

1244
43:03.400 --> 43:05.510
H-How else am I supposed to call you?

1245
43:06.360 --> 43:07.670
I can't call you buddy,

1246
43:08.360 --> 43:08.840
can I?

1247
43:10.760 --> 43:12.320
Y-You just do your thing.
